            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273434232?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The systemd v260 release has a new ModemManager integration for systemd-networkd. I've had a PR (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4329530031\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/513521\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/513521/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/513521\">#513521</a>) merged for configuring the networkd side of things but found the following are needed in the <code class=\"notranslate\">nixos/modemmanager</code> module:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>a new Polkit rule to allow systemd-networkd to communicate with ModemManager</li>\n<li>a way to start <code class=\"notranslate\">ModemManager.service</code> automatically\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>(see also: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2015768999\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/270809\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/270809/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/270809\">#270809</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In testing this I've also found that the ModemManager.service does not stop cleanly and that changing the service <code class=\"notranslate\">KillMode=mixed</code> fixes this (see <a href=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/latest/systemd.kill.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">man systemd.kill</code></a>).</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-darwin</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">NixOS test results</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">nixosTests.networking.networkd</code> fails with <code class=\"notranslate\">AssertionError: fou1 exists</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> result</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Generated using <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code></a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Command: <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review pr 516073</code><br>\nCommit: <code class=\"notranslate\">cabcc3873e5ac62ad64a0c82dff1630d9143440c</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">x86_64-linux</code></h3>\n<details>\n  <summary>⏩ 2 packages blacklisted:</summary>\n  <ul dir=\"auto\">\n    <li>nixos-install-tools</li>\n    <li>tests.nixos-functions.nixos-test</li>\n  </ul>\n</details>",
